<h2 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #d3222a; font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">Wednesday, April 26, 2023<br>6:00PM - 7:30PM<br>Glenwood Community Center<br>1888 Fairmont Ave, Columbus, OH 43223</h2>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">Mayor Andrew J. Ginther invites you to attend the State of the City: West Side Community Night as he shares accomplishments and future initiatives in your neighborhood. Please join us for dinner and an opportunity to speak with the Mayor and city department representatives.</p>
