<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start"> </p>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><em>Please RSVP by Friday, April 21.</em></p>
